      "side": 1,
      "message": "Am I right that a model uploaded with an empty version (which the storage model and the upload RPC allow) is now never used for a device that reports a version, so such devices stop mounting after upgrade? If that is intended, could this warning say the copy must be re-uploaded with a version, and the change get a release note? Otherwise, keep using it when every stored copy is unversioned.",
