      "writtenOn": "2026-11-19T10:07:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Only a missing device-reported model stops the retries, so a syntax error or unrelated parser failure runs up to 1 + sum(stored versions - 1) full rebuilds on one of the 4 gNMI pool threads before reporting. With a few OpenConfig releases stored that is easily 100+ rebuilds. Could we cap the attempts (and log once at INFO that lowering started)?",
      "revId": "864c462e0f538a3a4631f7fff8860ef972c0adab",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
    },
