      "side": 1,
      "message": "The retry with lower stored versions is a feature of its own, but the commit message does not mention it and no test reaches it (no test stores two copies of a dependency where the highest breaks the build). Could we add it to the message and add one test where lowering succeeds and one where it does not? Also.. this five-field state machine seems a bit over-designed for what is esentially a simple lookup. I\u0027m pretty sure 2 nested loops can do that trick as well.",
      "revId": "864c462e0f538a3a4631f7fff8860ef972c0adab",
